# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both build from the repository root).
# turbo prune needs every workspace package.json, so apps/mobile stays in; its heavy folders do not.

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Secrets: never send env files into an image (examples are fine)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Mobile-only artefacts and native projects
apps/mobile/.expo
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/assets

# Repository, docs and tooling
.git
.github
.claude
docs
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
docker-compose.yml
deploy/.env*
